# "Save slots" — find a slot, save a 14-byte record, load it back, then damage
# one byte behind the Kernal's back and have NvRead refuse it.
#
# The harness boots with an all-zero NVRAM, so there is no save yet and slot 0
# is the first free one.

expect ^NO SAVE YET - USING FREE SLOT 0$
expect ^LOADED LEVEL 3, SCORE 1250, ADA$
expect ^SLOT 0 IS DAMAGED - OWNER 90$
absent NO SAVE SLOTS|DID NOT ANSWER|EVERY SLOT
